1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,210
Your business runs on your enterprise
systems, and the data they hold.

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:06,480
Every order, invoice and contract.

3
00:00:06,770 --> 00:00:12,220
But when a business problem lands, can they help
you answer, and act, in the time that matters?

4
00:00:12,570 --> 00:00:17,500
For example: three key suppliers declare
backorders, one citing force majeure.

5
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:22,590
Procurement needs the items affected,
the stock cover, and alternate suppliers.

6
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:25,170
Can one system answer that? No.

7
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:29,000
It takes exports, IT tickets, SQL queries.

8
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:31,250
Days of back and forth.

9
00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:33,460
And it's never just one question.

10
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:37,410
Every team has them, across applications,
data platforms and archives.

11
00:00:37,770 --> 00:00:41,960
What if you could just ask, and let
AI agents run the work that repeats?

12
00:00:43,470 --> 00:00:45,200
Now, just ask.

13
00:00:45,790 --> 00:00:51,110
Data Ask answers across your applications
and contracts, with every figure cited.

14
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:53,700
Who else can deliver, and how fast?

15
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,800
Then your domain experts
turn it into a workflow.

16
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:02,100
Agents check stock, find
suppliers and draft the order.

17
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:03,120
A person approves.

18
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,590
Introducing Solix Enterprise AI.

19
00:01:06,630 --> 00:01:11,320
Put AI in the hands of your business, and
reimagine your business workflows with AI.

20
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:15,930
But the data you hold across your
applications isn't readable by AI.

21
00:01:15,970 --> 00:01:18,380
Data Sense makes it AI-activated.

22
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:21,280
Data Sense understands all your data.

23
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:27,320
On it, Data Ask answers, AI Warehouse builds,
and AI Agent Studio puts agents to work.

24
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,890
Your systems hold the data.

25
00:01:30,930 --> 00:01:34,100
Solix gives it meaning,
and puts AI to work on it.

26
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:37,700
Solix Enterprise AI.

27
00:01:37,740 --> 00:01:39,990
Put AI in the hands of your business.

